        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\n!theme plain\nautonumber\n\nactor User\nparticipant System\nparticipant \&quot;Payment Gateway\&quot; as Gateway\nparticipant Warehouse\n\n== Login &amp; Selection ==\nUser -&gt; System: Login\nactivate System\nSystem --&gt; User: Login Success\ndeactivate System\n\nUser -&gt; System: Add Items to Cart\nUser -&gt; System: Confirm Order\nactivate System\n\n== Stock Check ==\nSystem -&gt; Warehouse: Check Availability\nactivate Warehouse\nWarehouse --&gt; System: Stock Status\ndeactivate Warehouse\n\nalt Some Items Unavailable\n    System --&gt; User: Notify: Please Modify Cart\nelse All Items Available\n    System --&gt; User: Order Validated\n    \n    == Payment ==\n    User -&gt; System: Select Payment Method\n    \n    alt Payment Method: Online\n        System -&gt; Gateway: Process Payment\n        activate Gateway\n        Gateway --&gt; System: Payment Successful\n        deactivate Gateway\n        System --&gt; User: Send Order Confirmation\n    else Payment Method: On Delivery\n        System --&gt; User: Confirm Pay on Delivery\n    end\n    \n    == Fulfillment ==\n    System -&gt; Warehouse: Request Order Assembly\n    activate Warehouse\n    Warehouse --&gt; System: Request Acknowledged\n    deactivate Warehouse\nend\n\ndeactivate System\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="Nbg_iYCvhfVUvLMftdpU-1">
